        <mxCell id="wozuVRVlbLr0fXM-k-eT-45" edge="1" parent="UuifOyTEN0UUHOsnaCl9-1" source="wozuVRVlbLr0fXM-k-eT-24" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="wozuVRVlbLr0fXM-k-eT-27">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wozuVRVlbLr0fXM-k-eT-46" edge="1" parent="UuifOyTEN0UUHOsnaCl9-1" source="wozuVRVlbLr0fXM-k-eT-31" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="wozuVRVlbLr0fXM-k-eT-34">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wozuVRVlbLr0fXM-k-eT-47" parent="UuifOyTEN0UUHOsnaCl9-1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;size=20;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;What a member of Strategic Planning Workspace Viewer may do&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;; font-size: 10px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;  x  Open Strategic Planning Workspace                                        (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Portfolio plans shared with the user: read                               (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Work notes on shared plans and scenarios                                 (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Planning items of shared plans: read                                     (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Planning item cost fields (planned/actual cost, capex, opex, benefit, RO (sn_ppm_finance_read)&lt;br&gt;  x  Scenarios: read                                                          (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Goals and targets: read; Goals page in the workspace                     (sn_gf.goal_user_read; the page is shown to spw_goal_user_read, spw_goal_user, business_stakeholder)&lt;br&gt;  x  Demands, projects, programs, portfolios, resource plans: read            (sn_ppm_read; demand fields need &lt;b&gt;NEW&lt;/b&gt; field ACL)&lt;br&gt;  x  Cost plans, breakdowns, budget lines, expense lines: read                (sn_ppm_finance_read)&lt;br&gt;  x  Plan document pages: edit content                                        (OOTB ACLs on ap_read_only and sn_ppm_read)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;What this group does NOT have (and which of the other two has it: U = User, G = Goal Admin)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;; font-size: 10px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;  U   Portfolio plans: create, delete, edit fields                             (apw_user, owner or editor)&lt;br&gt;  U   Planning items: create, update, delete                                   (apw_user)&lt;br&gt;  U   Planning item planned capex, opex, benefit: write                        (spw_financial_user)&lt;br&gt;  U   Scenarios: create, edit, delete                                          (apw_user, owner or editor)&lt;br&gt;  U   Scenarios: approve                                                       (scenario_approver)&lt;br&gt;  U G Goals and targets: create; edit or delete goals that are own, contribute (sn_gf.goal_user; ACL conditions sn_gf_goal write/delete)&lt;br&gt;  U   Cost plans, breakdowns, expense lines: create, edit                      (sn_spm_financial_user, write conditional)&lt;br&gt;  U   Fund allocation to planning items                                        (spw_funding_user)&lt;br&gt;  U   Plan document pages: create, delete                                      (apw_user)&lt;br&gt;  U   Import/export planning items to Agile and PPM, strategies CRUD, mileston (based on role descriptions of sn_align_cmn_int.user, strategy_planner, milestone_editor, pf_basic)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ServiceNow intent.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ap_read_only&lt;/b&gt; is the vendor role for a read-only audience: &quot;Can view portfolio plans (Planning and Scoring pages) and free-form roadmaps that are shared with them. Also, can add notes, comments, or attachments to portfolio plans and roadmaps that are shared with them.&quot; A plan becomes visible only when its owner shares it (Manage Access: users or groups as Editor or Viewer); sharing the plan with this group makes it visible to every member. &lt;b&gt;sn_ppm_finance_read&lt;/b&gt; is the vendor read-only role for financials (cost plans, budgets, planning item cost fields).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="410" width="1144" x="-1150" y="1447" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
