          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6aMUmCpfSBnF4YKSjrgM-43" edge="1" parent="dkSC0maqcZLFTQT4VlpO-1" source="6aMUmCpfSBnF4YKSjrgM-30" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="6aMUmCpfSBnF4YKSjrgM-31">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6aMUmCpfSBnF4YKSjrgM-44" parent="dkSC0maqcZLFTQT4VlpO-1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;size=20;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="&lt;b&gt;What a member of Strategic Planning Goal Admin may do&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;; font-size: 10px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;  x  Open Strategic Planning Workspace                                        (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Portfolio plans shared with the user: read                               (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Work notes on shared plans and scenarios                                 (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Planning items of shared plans: read                                     (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Scenarios: read                                                          (ap_read_only)&lt;br&gt;  x  Goals and targets: read; Goals page in the workspace                     (sn_gf.goal_user_read; the page is shown to spw_goal_user_read, spw_goal_user, business_stakeholder)&lt;br&gt;  x  Goals and targets: create; edit or delete goals that are own, contribute (sn_gf.goal_user; ACL conditions sn_gf_goal write/delete)&lt;br&gt;  x  Demands, projects, programs, portfolios, resource plans: read            (sn_ppm_read; demand fields need the &lt;b&gt;NEW&lt;/b&gt; field ACL)&lt;br&gt;  x  Plan document pages: edit content                                        (OOTB ACLs on ap_read_only and sn_ppm_read)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;What this group does NOT have (and which of the other two has it: V = Viewer, U = User)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;; font-size: 10px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;  U   Portfolio plans: create, delete, edit fields                             (apw_user, owner or editor)&lt;br&gt;  U   Planning items: create, update, delete                                   (apw_user)&lt;br&gt;  V U Planning item cost fields (planned/actual cost, capex, opex, benefit, RO (sn_ppm_finance_read)&lt;br&gt;  U   Planning item planned capex, opex, benefit: write                        (spw_financial_user)&lt;br&gt;  U   Scenarios: create, edit, delete                                          (apw_user, owner or editor)&lt;br&gt;  U   Scenarios: approve                                                       (scenario_approver)&lt;br&gt;  V U Cost plans, breakdowns, budget lines, expense lines: read                (sn_ppm_finance_read)&lt;br&gt;  U   Cost plans, breakdowns, expense lines: create, edit                      (sn_spm_financial_user, write conditional)&lt;br&gt;  U   Fund allocation to planning items                                        (spw_funding_user)&lt;br&gt;  U   Plan document pages: create, delete                                      (apw_user)&lt;br&gt;  U   Import/export planning items to Agile and PPM, strategies CRUD, mileston (role descriptions of sn_align_cmn_int.user, strategy_planner, milestone_editor, pf_basic)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ServiceNow intent.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;spw_goal_user&lt;/b&gt; is the vendor role &quot;Can view the Goals page in Strategic Planning Workspace and edit goals and targets&quot;;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;spw_goal_user_read&lt;/b&gt; &quot;Can view the Goals page&quot;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Both carry no ACL of their own: the Goals page of the workspace is shown to holders of these roles (or business_stakeholder), and the record rights come from the contained &lt;b&gt;sn_gf.goal_user &lt;/b&gt;(&quot;create, read, edit, archive and delete goals&quot;, limited by ACL conditions to own, contributed, sub-goals of those, or ownerless goals) and &lt;b&gt;sn_gf.goal_user_read&lt;/b&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The vendor administrator role is &lt;b&gt;sn_gf.goal_admin&lt;/b&gt; (&quot;can update the goal preferences&quot;, plus unconditional write and delete on goals and targets);&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New;font-size:10px;white-space:pre&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="431" width="1072" x="18" y="1588" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
